{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04034.SBN#0001", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04034.SBN", "offset": 269, "capacity": 54, "raw_hex": "f154f276f0af8143f0a5f0b1f0c0f7d12f2ff0c6f0f7f94bf1acf1c78143f8b2f392f0f32f2ff0dbf14ff9a9f0d3f181f0b2f0f08144", "baseline_text": "있잖아，하나비…//생각해 보면，이 팀은//신기한 인연이네．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "なあ、花火……//思えば、このチームは//不思議なつながりだな。", "pointer_offset": 228, "unit": "dialogue:6003d52f6b695e02", "prior_review": "번역 검수"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04034.SBN#0002", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04034.SBN", "offset": 330, "capacity": 52, "raw_hex": "f0d8f27ef0f0f0eff7d12f2ff0dff0f4f9d7f174f0aef0a8f15781432f2ff375f152f8f4f1b5f957f17cf27bf0b8f261f0eff7d1", "baseline_text": "그렇네요…//제도와 파리라는，//접점도 없는 관계니까요…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "そうですね……//帝都と巴里という、//接点のない関係ですから……", "pointer_offset": 232, "unit": "dialogue:231d67be380b963f", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04034.SBN#0003", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04034.SBN", "offset": 393, "capacity": 58, "raw_hex": "f0b5f0b5f144f8abf247f944f1b5f1f3f2b8f0a8f1c781432f2ff0b2f27ef8f1f2c8f960f1bdf9c6f1ccf0f42f2ff1b5f1f3f29ef0a4f0eff7d1", "baseline_text": "오오가미 씨가 없었더라면，//이렇게 함께 싸울 일도//없었겠지요…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "大神さんがいなければ、//こうやって共に戦っていることは//なかったのでしょうね……", "pointer_offset": 236, "unit": "dialogue:f9c7c6a7d6b51a22", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04034.SBN#0004", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04034.SBN", "offset": 474, "capacity": 40, "raw_hex": "f2c3f7d1f0e2f0e4f0b9f0f1f1572f2ff0e9f0a6f0a5f984f2bff8f3f299f8b2f1b7f0cff1d4f7d1", "baseline_text": "음…대장에게는//감사하고 싶은 것이 많다만…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "うむ……隊長には、//感謝したいことが多くあるが……", "pointer_offset": 240, "unit": "dialogue:fef10e72ff554e7f", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04034.SBN#0005", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04034.SBN", "offset": 525, "capacity": 52, "raw_hex": "f144f8e4f0e9f0a6f14bf948fa57f299f0f32f2ff46ef951f0ebf56ef1daf0c82f2ff1d4f0b1f8f1f94bfa4ef299f0b2f0cff7d1", "baseline_text": "가장 감사해야 할 것은//멋진 동료들을//만나게 해 준 것이다…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "最も感謝したいのは//すばらしい仲間たちに//会わせてくれたことだ……", "pointer_offset": 244, "unit": "dialogue:4eba552b2d4640a3", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04034.SBN#0006", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04034.SBN", "offset": 592, "capacity": 48, "raw_hex": "8175f46ef951f0ebf56e8176f0a8f0b8f7d12f2ff0bbf0aef0dbf1d9f184f15781432f2ff186f946f1ccf0b2f0f0f7d1", "baseline_text": "「멋진 동료」라니…//글리신치고는，//드문 일이네…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "「すばらしい仲間」だなんて……//グリシーヌにしては、//めずらしいわね……", "pointer_offset": 248, "unit": "dialogue:70202d42c5f0bdfc", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04034.SBN#0007", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04034.SBN", "offset": 665, "capacity": 38, "raw_hex": "f1adf2cef2cef7d1f0b2f299f0f42f2ff0b5f0b5f144f8abfa47f250f1cef0b2f0f0f0ef8144", "baseline_text": "우후후…이것도//오오가미 씨 덕분이네요．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "うふふ……これも、//大神さんのおかげですね。", "pointer_offset": 252, "unit": "dialogue:447921924c740d1e", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04034.SBN#0008", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04034.SBN", "offset": 795, "capacity": 50, "raw_hex": "f0a58143f0a5f0b1f0c0f7d12f2ff283f0aef8a4f0adf0a881b82f2ff0b2f8dff1f7f2d6f8a3f0d0f0aff144f29ef0cf81b8", "baseline_text": "하，하나비…//놀리지 마라∈//이제 전투로 돌아가겠다∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "は、花火……//茶化すでない！//もう、戦闘に戻るぞ！", "pointer_offset": 256, "unit": "dialogue:493db5c9a10cacbc", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04034.SBN#0009", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04034.SBN", "offset": 761, "capacity": 22, "raw_hex": "f2b381b82f2ff0bbf0aef0db8143f14ff0cff1b281b8", "baseline_text": "앗∈//글리신，기다려∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "あん！//グリシーヌ、待って∈", "pointer_offset": 260, "unit": "dialogue:176a59b676fca675", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04034.SBN#0010", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04034.SBN", "offset": 790, "capacity": 4, "raw_hex": "6d61696e", "baseline_text": "main", "kind": "ascr", "source": "main", "pointer_offset": 264, "unit": "dialogue:0d6e4079e36703eb", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
